window.products.push({"id":426034,"name":"SUSTEAS Electric Kettle - 57oz Hot Tea Kettle Water Boiler with Thermometer, 1500W Fast Heating Stainless Steel Tea Pot, Cordless with LED Indicator, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g5rGKRXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【ECO-FRIENDLY MATERIALS | BUILT TO LAST】: The interior of the SUSTEAS electric kettle is made of 18/8 stainless steel (including spout and lid), which greatly improves durability and safety. All plastic parts in contact with water are BPA free for peace of mind. The exterior surface is treated with electroplating paint, which is wear-resistant and scratch-resistant, making it easy to maintain. ✅【DESIGNED FOR SAFETY AND FAST HEATING】: This water boiler kettle electric with power 1500W can easily boil 1.7 liters (7 cups) of water in 5-6 minutes, meaning you can enjoy a cup of coffee or tea in no time. Enjoy the safety features of Auto Shut-Off and Boil-Dry Protection with powerful STRIX thermostat technology, plus the one-touch switch has a built-in LED indicator for easy operation even at night. ✅【PLEASING TO THE EYE丨MAKING TEA EASILY】: Incorporating a vintage aesthetic, SUSTEAS updates the stalwart electric tea kettle with modern hues and features, and the classic lines and easy-to-read thermometer offer a bit of timeless old-world style. The ergonomic heat-resistant PP handle is designed for easy, stay-cool pouring. The honeycomb filter and the V-shaped gathering spout make the pouring water concentrated, and it will not drip and wet the table top. ✅【EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE】: The electric kettle is designed with a 4-inch wide diameter and a detachable lid, which can be cleaned 360 degrees without dead ends, making washing and filling a breeze. In addition, the snap-on lid is closely fitted with the body of the teapot to effectively prevent water leakage and burns. The base takes into account the characteristics of storage and anti-skid, which is both practical and beautiful. ✅【KITCHENWARE EXPERTS AT YOUR SERVICE】: SUSTEAS hot water kettle look exquisite and stunning, helping you create a coordinated kitchen for both modern and retro homes. We are dedicated to providing premium service and stand behind our products with a 1-year warranty. (🌟🌟NOTICE: Do not touch the kettle body or open the lid when the water is boiling. Make sure the cover is closed when working. Please keep the kettle out of the reach of children.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g5rGKRXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUSTEAS","source_asin":"B0B715CL77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B715CL77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B715CL77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
