window.products.push({"id":426050,"name":"Greenland Home Bella Ruffled Quilt Set, King/California King (5 Piece)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rtSB63l1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ruffles of floral printed fabrics are carefully sewn to an off-white ground on the face of this frayed edge quilt, giving it a shabby chic look and feel. Eye-catching yet casual, this romantic style coordinates with a variety of colors and matches a wide range of home decor themes. Oversized for better coverage on today’s deeper mattresses. Cotton face, back and fill. Prewashed and preshrunk. Machine washable. Set includes: Quilt, two pillow shams (one sham only per Twin set), plus two coordinating decorative pillows. Twin/Twin XL Dimensions: Quilt 68x88”, Sham 20x26”, Decorative Pillows 16x16” each. Full/Queen Dimensions: Quilt 90x90”, Shams 20x26” each, Decorative Pillows 16x16” each. King/Cal King Dimensions: Quilt 105x95”, Shams: 20x36” each, Decorative Pillows 16x16” each. Machine washable quilt, shams and pillow covers. Pillow inserts are spot clearn only. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rtSB63l1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greenland Home","source_asin":"B00575TG8A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00575TG8A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00575TG8A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":426051,"name":"CDN Digital Food Thermometer with Probe, 3-in-1 Functions (Thermometer, Timer, Clock), Easy to Read Display, White (DTTC-W)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Prs34pTFL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The popular do-it-all Combo Probe Thermometer, Timer & Clock (DTTC) now has added features that make it even more functional than ever before. The three-in-one thermometer plus timer features an updated design and easy-to-read buttons, along with the addition of a higher heat probe cord, giving it maximum versatility and ease of use in the kitchen and at the grill. The new high-heat probe cord has the ability to withstand temperatures up to 600°F/315°C, ideal for grilling, broiling and other high-heat applications. The new cord ensures the precise temperature measurement needed for best culinary results. Features: 5.5\" (14.0 cm) probe/3' (91.4 cm) high heat sensor cable (heat resistant up to 600°F/315°C). Dual progress display • Counts up/down. Available in white and silver. Amazon.com Overcooked roast beef is a thing of the past with this handy 3-in-1 digital device. The timer can be set to go off when the meat reaches a desired internal temperature; the 7-inch stainless-steel probe stays in the roast during cooking, with the oven door closing right over the flexible 39-inch cable. The digital thermometer/timer is also useful for candy-making: the clip attaches the probe to the side of a saucepan, and again, the alarm can be programmed to sound after a certain number of minutes or when a particular temperature is reached. Different sounds for the timer and thermometer alarms avoid confusion. The LED screen displays three readings: the current time with seconds in large digits, internal food temperature, and the set temperature. A switch changes the scale from Fahrenheit to Celsius, with a temperature range of 14 to 392 degrees Fahrenheit (10 to 200 degrees Celsius). A hinge in the 4-3/4-by-2-3/4-inch control module allows it to sit upright on a countertop or stovetop, while magnetic strips on the back secure it to a metal surface. Buttons are clearly marked and instructions provided for setting temperatures and the count-up/count-down timer. The device is also useful for testing the accuracy of oven temperatures so that settings and cooking times can be adjusted accordingly. A two-year warranty covers the device against defects. One AA battery is included for operation. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Prs34pTFL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDN","source_asin":"B0BS4QMCLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS4QMCLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS4QMCLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
