window.products.push({"id":426072,"name":"Hormodin 1 Rooting Compound (Roses, Home Garden, Greenhouse Plants)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310W5907XAL._AC_.jpg","description":"The most convenient, effective rooting compound you can buy. Over the years, thousands of nurserymen and gardeners have come to rely on Hormodin as one of the most dependable rooting compounds available. There's no measuring or mixing required. Just dip the cuttings into the powder, tap off the excess and plant. It's that simple. Hormodin #1 contains 0.1% active ingredient for roses, home garden and greenhouse plants (good for 35,000 cuttings). 1 lb. jug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310W5907XAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A.M. Leonard","source_asin":"B001FA6FA8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FA6FA8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FA6FA8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
