window.products.push({"id":426102,"name":"Lush Decor Navy Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Curtain Panel Set, Long Floral Polyester Themed Pattern (84\" x 52\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kPuntRfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for curtains that can improve the appearance of your room? Give your windows a touch of European charm with the Lush Decor Navy Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Curtain Panel Set! Finding the right size, color, and fabric type to complement your interior home design makes the search for living room, master bedroom, or guest bedroom curtains just another stressful chore to add to your checklist. At Lush Decor, we want to help make shopping for home decor fun and stress-free. Our Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly Curtains are the perfect long floral curtains for any room in your home. This 2-piece curtain panel set exudes a stylish vintage vibe with a pattern that will remind you of all things Paris. The butterflies, roses, Eiffel Tower silhouettes, postal service stamps, and script are striking and elegant against the rich, dark background. The gorgeous design is eye-catching but will beautifully accent many design styles.Our curtains are made of 100% polyester, which is known for its strength and non-wrinkling properties. They are easy to wash; simply machine wash them in a mesh bag on a cold, gentle cycle, and then hang to dry. You can rest assured that the print won’t fade or bleed in the wash. Lightly iron the curtains if needed. Installation should be just as easy as washing and maintaining your curtains, so we include grommets and a 3-inch back tab rod pocket to make insertion, removal, and adjustments easy and convenient.At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding. Add the Lush Decor Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Curtain Panel Set to your home for an elegant, vintage accent that will instantly elevate the look of any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kPuntRfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B08432CRK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08432CRK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08432CRK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":426103,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast Iron Paella Pan, 3.25 qt., Cerise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EiCgMx6lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Paella, a rice dish that originated in the Valencia region of Spain, is named after the pan in which it is cooked. Indeed, the pan is crucial to the dish. Different regions of Spain may add varying meats and vegetables, but no matter the ingredients, the identifying mark of a good paella is the socarrat, a layer of toasted rice at the bottom best achieved in a wide, shallow pan.Le Creuset's heat-retaining cast iron aids in the development of this crust, as does the matte black enamel interior. The large surface area keeps the rice layer shallow and allows excess moisture to evaporate, so the socarrat can form.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EiCgMx6lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B014T1FTGA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014T1FTGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014T1FTGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
