window.products.push({"id":426183,"name":"Yunnoo Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner - 8 inch Non-stick Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners,Oil-proof Air Fryer Liner,Air Fryer Paper For Baking, Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H-ILFEwcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATIONS： Material: Food-grade natural wood pulp Features: Food-grade, Waterproof, Oil-proof, Non-stick Inner Diameter: 8 inches External Diameter: 9 inches Height: 1.8 inches (Larger size, Fill better! Perfect for 6 and lager quart Air Fryer.) Application: Air fryer, Microwave, Oven, Steamer, Stove 🤔 What size air fryer does the liners work for? -These are round non-stick disposable air fryer liners, A 6~8L air fryer is recommended. If it not big enough, please unfold to expanding the paper liner. 🤔 What is the maximum temperature that these are safe for? -About 450℉ / 230℃ 🤔 What material are these air fryer papers made of? Will using it affect the taste of the food? -The air fryer baking paper is made of natural wood pulp ,which has no effect on the taste of food. It is a three-layer structure. The top and bottom are protected by plant silicon oil layer, and the middle is wood pulp. 🤔 Can I put the fryer paper in preheat mode? -For the safety of your body and property, please do not use it during preheating,don't put paper in the air fryer alone. If you do, it will more than likely catch on fire. 🤔 Is there anything I need to pay attention to when using this air fryer liner? -Please note that: 1. Do not put the empty paper in when the air fryer is preheating. 2. Please always use with Enough Food on the paper liners. 3. Do not touch the baking paper directly with the flame or fire, otherwise, the baking paper will burn. 🤟🏼 Take one , Let you show your talents without hesitation! 💕","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H-ILFEwcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yunnoo","source_asin":"B09TY2NY9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TY2NY9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TY2NY9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
