window.products.push({"id":426352,"name":"Bush Furniture Cabot Small Computer Desk with Hutch and Keyboard Tray, 48W, Linen White Oak & Cabot 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet, Linen White Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jMd8ElnXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Bush Furniture Cabot Small Computer Desk with Hutch and Keyboard Tray, 48W, Linen White OakThe Bush Furniture Cabot 48W Small Computer Desk with Hutch and Keyboard Tray presents an ideal home office solution for working in compact areas. Set up with your computer and all the materials you need to stay productive on a desktop that supports up to 200 pounds. The work surface also includes a built-in wire management grommet to keep pesky cords and cables out of the way while a pull-out shelf conveniently stores your keyboard or laptop. Stash writing utensils, notepads and other office supplies in the Small Desk's box drawer and organize additional materials inside the lower storage cabinet. The Desk Hutch adds a center cabinet with a stylish fluted glass door in between two open compartments for flexible storage and display. Find the perfect look to complement your tastes with attractive Espresso Oak, Harvest Cherry, Linen White Oak and Modern Gray finish options. The Cabot Collection also includes a Lateral Filing Cabinet, Tall 5 Shelf Bookcase and 6 Cube Organizer for additional storage as well as a Mid Back Tufted Office Chair and Mid Back Leather Box Chair to complete your workspace with the same elegant style (coordinating items sold separately). This home office desk with storage has been tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty.Bush Furniture Cabot 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet, Linen White OakDesign your dream office with the Bush Furniture Cabot Collection Two Drawer Lateral File Cabinet for Home Office!  About Us Based in Jamestown, NY, Bush has been a leading manufacturer of casegoods and ready-to-assemble furniture for over 60 years. Our mission is simple: To create a diverse line of stylish, on-trend products for every room and any budget with safe, stylish designs built for the way you live. By creating and producing a growing number of unique designs for today’s homes, we're able to help our customers find the perfect fit for their personal space and taste.  Introduce this graceful decor piece into your office for the following features: Sturdy Build: 200lb weight capacity, 60lb per drawer Generously Sized Drawers: fits letters, legal and A4 files Everything You Need: shipped with detailed instructions for a quick build Stylish Hardware: chrome-finished handles Rigorously Tested: for stain resistance, durability, tip stability and more  This legal size filing cabinet is the premium solution to your home office storage needs!  Dimensions 19.69\"D x 31.38\"W x 30.16\"H  This 2 drawer file cabinet lets you stay on top of your filing and create a coordinated workspace. The height and color of this office cabinet match with other Cabot Collection desks, such as the Cabot Corner Desk or L Shaped Desk, so you can extend your work surface area seamlessly. The gorgeous finish and distinctive lines make this wide 2 drawer file cabinet ideal for home offices, but also bedrooms and living rooms where it can be used to store clothes, toys, books or any other items.  Take your workspace to a new level with the Bush Furniture Cabot Collection Office Lateral File Cabinets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jMd8ElnXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BYGD4V1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYGD4V1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYGD4V1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
