window.products.push({"id":426497,"name":"Ice Ball Maker Mold 2 PCS - Bongpuda Silicone Large Circle Ice Cube Tray for Whiskey, 2.5 Inch & 2 Inch Easy Release Round Ice Sphere Tray with Lids &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ho+8fnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡[ No Leakage & Easy Release ] Silicone tray has a unique 8-button design with better sealing and no side leakage. The ice hockey is complete and clear. A soft silicone cover and the hard plastic bottom are key here, you can easily open the tray and release the enlarged ice hockey ✔️[ Perfect Size Iceball Maker ] The diameter of the large ice cube molds cavity is 2.5 inches, and the diameter of the small ice cube tray cavity is 2 inches. It's great to freeze six big and small ice hockey balls of perfect size at one time 🥃[ Slowly Melting Ice ] Round ice cube mold is the perfect choice for summer delicacies, such as whisky mixed drinks, cocktails, wine, fruit juice, iced coffee, popsicles, pudding, etc. Big ice hockey doesn't melt easily. It's the perfect choice to keep it cold. This is a must-have for cold drinks! 💕[ Stable & Durable ] The hard bottom tray makes it impossible for the ice mold to overflow when moving; Anti-tilt design at the bottom for easy balance and stacking. The reusable ice cube with a high-quality plastic bottom and food-grade silica gel top will not deform, crack or break like a rigid mold after freezing 🥰[ Easy To Fill ] Easy to fill with the funnels they provide and easy to store in the freezer. It makes drinks look so classy. Great gift idea for anyone, or for someone to add to their at-home bar","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ho+8fnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bongpuda","source_asin":"B09Y55ZSBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y55ZSBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y55ZSBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
