window.products.push({"id":426635,"name":"Led Christmas Net Lights for Bushes 132 Led, 5ft x 5ft Christmas Net Lights Outdoor Mesh Lights Tree Trunk Lights Green Wire Christmas Decorations for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yNRZRb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Popular Outdoor Christmas Lights】Wrapping bushes with lights has been a popular outdoor Christmas decorating idea for many years.Net lights are string lights that have been connected to form a grid, which can easily cover the exterior of bushes or tree trunks in a fast, hassle free installation process.Our 5ft x 5ft led Christmas net light string is perfect to cover the small hedge, deck, fence, patio, garden, bushes,trees and back yard shrubs outside your house. 【UL Certified Guarantee 100% Safety】: These LED outdoor Christmas lights were strictly tested and completely fulfill the requirements of UL safety standard. The LED bulbs keep at a low temperature and cool to touch so even after long hours of use they are still safe to touch for children and pets. The 50 high-efficiency LED bulbs are environmentally friendly, and reduce power usage. Just plug into an outlet and use it without worry. (CAUTION:Please keep the plug away from water). 【Connectable and One-step-use】Per strand christmas decorations outdoor net lights have male and female plugs,allowing connect up to 15 units simultaneously to cover a larger area with the 5ft x 5ft net.These net lights outdoor mesh lights also designed with a long leading and tail wire,and our meticulous packing method makes the Christmas bush lights fold like an accordion, so no worry about knots. It's perfect for outdoor and indoor decorations. 【Durable and Sturdy Design】: Different from other mesh net lights with weakly and very thin wires, we use the high quality and durable green wires, which can avoid breaking apart easily when use in bushes or trees. The strong grid makes it tough and sturdy, not easy to break apart and overheat after long hours of usage. Compared with other clear wire net lights, our green wire net mesh lights can perfectly integrated with bushes. 【Waterproof and Worry-free Warranty】: This mesh lights is IP44 waterproof and can be used indoors or outdoors in any weather condition.For guaranteed satisfaction our net Christmas lights are made to last and are covered by Worry-free warranty. A spare fuse and 2 spare bulbs are included with each set. If you have any question about product and service, please feel free to contact us, we will do our best to help you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yNRZRb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wabarle","source_asin":"B0BHTL5773","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHTL5773","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHTL5773","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
