window.products.push({"id":426657,"name":"GLACER Bathroom Medicine Cabinet with Mirror, Bathroom Mirror Cabinet with Adjustable Shelf and Open Compartments, Wall Mounted Mirrored Medicine Cabi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615fHnFxYeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[Mirrored Medicine Cabinet]: Whether you're getting ready for a hot date or a Zoom meeting, this mirrored medicine cabinet has got your back. Keep your bath essentials tucked away in style, while basking in the flawless reflection of its high-definition mirror. So why settle for a humdrum cabinet when you can have this chic and functional stunner in your bathroom? [Adjustable Shelf for Flexible Storage]: The inner shelf of this wondrous contraption boasts not one, not two, but three adjustable positions to cater to your specific preferences, granting you maximum space utilization for all your daily needs. This bathroom wall cabinet also features three open storage cubbies. No more rummaging around for that one elusive item! With this cabinet, everything has its rightful place, making daily fetches a breeze. [Exquisite Lacquered Surface]: Did you know that the bathroom mirror cabinet we're talking about has a really high-quality paint job? It's so smooth and water-proof that it's perfect for use in the bathroom or other humid environments. So, if you're someone who likes to keep their bathroom organized and functional, this mirror cabinet might be just what you need! Not only is it practical, but it also looks great and will add a touch of elegance to any space. [Easy to Assemble and Maintain]: This bathroom medicine cabinet with mirror comes with easy-to-follow step by step instructions and all the necessary hardware to get it installed in no time. And the best part? Its smooth lacquered surface makes it a breeze to clean and remove any pesky stains. So you can say goodbye to the hassle of scrubbing and hello to a sparkling, sleek finish. With this cabinet, you'll have all your medicine and toiletries conveniently stored and easily accessible. [GLACER Promise]: If for any reason you're not satisfied with your purchase, please reach out to us. We're committed to making things right for you and finding a solution that works. Our team will respond within 24 hours to offer feasible suggestions until the problem is solved. We believe in going above and beyond for our customers and making sure they're happy with their purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615fHnFxYeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLACER","source_asin":"B0BWMJ5X16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMJ5X16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMJ5X16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
