window.products.push({"id":426714,"name":"UhearteyeSmile Burlap Tree Skirt, Burlap Christmas Tree Skirt with Ruffled Border 48 Inches Burlap Jute Tree Skirts for Xmas Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Our beautifully burlap Tree Skirt will add more holiday atmosphere to your Christmas tree and home décor. Its simple design will give your Christmas tree a warm look.Your Christmas decor won't be complete without a beautiful burlap Christmas tree skirt. Warm and full of texture, burlap fabric is the absolutely perfect neutral complement to all your Christmas decor.tree skirts are not only fetching—they're also functional. They're great for covering up unsightly tree trunks and stands, and they also protect your floors and carpets from any fallen pine needles. Plus, they can help tie your holiday theme or color scheme together for a more cohesive look. Features: 1.Strong DurableBlend in with any style home decor. 2.This generous Burlap Tree Skirt, also a nice Christmas gift for your family or friends.. 3.Bring holiday charm with burlap christmas tree skirt to make a rustic homey Christmas feeling. 4.Made of high quality Jute burlap, it will protect your floor from wayward tree needles. The tree skirt features long-lasting durability that allows you to use it for year by year! Product Details: 1.Colour: As the pictures shown 2.Material: High quality refined burlap. 3.Dimensions: 48inch in diameter Package Including: 1 x Burlap Tree Skirt Product care: Hand wash separately in cold water. Do not wring. Lay flat to dry. No chlorine bleach. Do not iron or tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UhearteyeSmile","source_asin":"B09BR5J3PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BR5J3PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BR5J3PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
