window.products.push({"id":426871,"name":"Fur Bean Bag 48 x 36 Inches Brown Bean Bag Chair Cover (No Fillers) Home Laraine Plush Corduroy Bean Bag Cover Zipper Double Suture for Organizing Chi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BHCs2VQnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤❤ QUALITY CONSTRUCT: Our bean bag furniture for adults and kids is made with durable foam stuffing, encased in velvet, passion suede with double stitching for maximum strength. Designed to support small rowdy toddlers up to large men and women, these stuffed chairs are built to last. Bean BAgs are double stitched for extra strength and double zipped for extra security. Zip heads are covered to prevent scratches on the floor and are also child proof. ❤❤ ONE CHAIR, SO MANY USES: Lightweight and mobile, you can move them from room to room with ease. Great for gaming and studying in teen bedrooms and college student dorm rooms or even family movie night, game night, play dates, and reading, these simple seats are the perfect room addition ❤❤ CONFORM TO COZY: Supersoft and velvety to the touch, these multicolor bean bags are great for sitting, napping, and lounging. We sure babies, toddlers and kids will love how much room they offer while adults enjoy the single sized seating. ❤❤ HOW TO CLEAN IT : Set the washer on the gentle cycle and the lowest spin cycle setting. This will help prevent excessive tangling from too much agitation. . Spills and stains from food or mud should be cleaned up immediately for the best results. Never place faux fur in a hot dryer. It can melt! Allow the cover to air dry. If it is tangled, use a wide-toothed comb to loosen up stubborn fur. ❤❤ YES..YOU CAN GIFT IT UP : Nice gift for those who can't stand for a long time, especially if their work needs to ..they can use it for relaxing from time to time to have a little comfort in their little breaks. Its a great housewarming gift, where its a piece of decoration to be placed in the corners of the house or in the living rooms for relaxing..It is a unique way to express your feelings to your friends, where it is a fun way to relax in front of the TV or to work on the Laptop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BHCs2VQnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nexis Sundry","source_asin":"B07W75VX9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W75VX9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W75VX9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
