window.products.push({"id":426905,"name":"Baxton Studio 424-6913-AMZ Platform, Queen, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":251.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6xAkk4DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This stylish full size platform bed features a clean, modern design and a versatile walnut finish. Its sprung slats will provide added support in conjunction with a quality mattress, helping you get a good night's sleep. With a simple and elegant design, the Eloina bed lends itself well to a multitude of interior styles. Pair with a colorful geometric print duvet set to channel this season's prolific Scandi trend, or add soft velvet and faux fur accessories for a look that oozes boutique hotel chic. Constructed of eco-friendly solid rubber wood and poplar, the bed frame is built to last. Combining slatted design headboard with tapering degree showcases the retro feel of the piece. The tapered legs complete the look. Low footboard creates an illusion of open space while the bed under clearance area provides some storage space. Made in Malaysia, the platform bed requires assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6xAkk4DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B01DBKZXCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DBKZXCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DBKZXCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":426906,"name":"Aston & Arden Recycled Solid Turkish Bath Towels - (Set of 2) Soft & Absorbent Eco-Friendly Aegean Cotton Blend, 600 GSM, Decorative Towel for Bathroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7142XADWgbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY RECYCLED COTTON: Aegean towels are made with the finest long-staple virgin cotton from Turkey blended with 50% eco-friendly recycled cotton. The Global Recycled Standard (GRS) certification ensures that these towels are officially recycled blended textiles by the IDFL standards, as a global leader in quality assurance since 1978. Renew, relax, and restore with peace of mind knowing that this luxurious product was produced sustainably by the highest global standards. FINE TURKISH COTTON BLEND: The sunshine's warmth over the west coast of Turkey provides an extended growing season creating an ideal growing window for Aegean cotton crops. This region enjoys the perfect marriage of climate, topography, nutrient-rich soil, and location, resulting in the prestigious Aegean cotton we use in our towels. BOUTIQUE HOTEL STYLE: The Aegean Eco-Friendly Recycled Bath Towel Collection was designed with thoughtful features, including a six-color palette, a low-twist weave, extra strong hems, and a textured woven dobby. Pair these gorgeous solid bath towels with their stripe-on-white sister collection designed with an exact-match color stripe dobby on a pristine white terry towel. COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: The Aegean Collection was inspired by a stunning region of Turkey for its rich earth tones. Colors include subtle shades of frosted green, weathered grey, shale grey, deep pool blue, pearl white, and wheat beige. Make a sophisticated decor statement with distinguished bathroom towels from Aston & Arden's Aegean collection. RING SPUN ECO-FRIENDLY RECYCLED COTTON: Ring spun virgin cotton fibers (long-staple cotton) are spun and stretched, creating finer, softer yarn. When eco-friendly recycled cotton fibers (from high-quality recycled new remnants) are blended and spun together with virgin cotton, the result is undetectable as recycled. When woven into towels the result is a superior quality plush textile that rivals the best towels on the market today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7142XADWgbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BLT7VWZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLT7VWZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLT7VWZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
