window.products.push({"id":426999,"name":"DriftAway Christopher Peacock Floral Pattern Thermal Insulated Blackout Window Curtain Valance Rod Pocket 2 Layers 52 Inch by 18 Inch Plus 2 Inch Head","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aW-aXBHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester PACKAGE INCLUDES: Single valance. Made of 100% polyester, imported. DESIGN AND STYLE: This valance is designed by peacock paintings and floral botanical patterns, very sophisticated design. Beautiful peacocks flying together symbolized good wills in the future. The design is dignified and will enliven your house instantly. UPGRADED VERSION: Our valance with practical back lining will enhance your privacy, also block up outside sound. The lined fabric will prevent topper strong sunshine going through your window, prevent your skin and your furniture from harmful UV rays. Our fabric is environmentally friendly, good for everyone. SIZE AND HEADER TYPE: 52\"W X 18\"L+2\"header. 3'' Rod pocket construction slides easily onto your curtain rod for quick installation. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle in a mesh bag, use only non-chlorine bleach. Tumble dry low, iron on a cool setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aW-aXBHjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DriftAway","source_asin":"B08DXJ471R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-426999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DXJ471R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DXJ471R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":427000,"name":"Dalstrong Meat Cleaver Knife - 7 inch - Centurion Series - Swedish 14C28N High Carbon Stainless Steel - G10 Handle - Razor Sharp - w/Sheath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CYbYNpDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Centurion Series 7\" Cleaver has the broad bench-style blade you’d expect from a meat cleaver, but the thinner spine tapers to a finer point, making this a versatile all-around kitchen favorite. Enjoy the chopping power to get through tough squashes and melons, or use it to mince vegetables, separate florets of cauliflower or broccoli, slice boneless meats like beef, poultry or fish, or flatten garlic bulbs. At its height, the Roman Empire was the most extensive political and social structure in western civilization, stretching over 5,000 km of territory. Leading its expansion were the noble but ruthless Centurions. Strong, agile, balanced, and always ready to execute the task at hand — these are just a few of the attributes that determined whether a soldier was chosen, and were contemplated heavily in the crafting of this regal knife series. Command your kitchen effortlessly with the strength and sharpness of high-carbon Swedish steel, rated at 58+ Rockwell hardness for impressive cutting prowess. Hand-sharpened to 12-14 degrees, you can slice through every obstacle with the might of 80 trained soldiers. The hand-polished, satin-finish blade is paired with the ultra-durable and tactile G10 handle, ensuring that you’ll never lose your grip in the heat of culinary battle. Reinforced with a red G10 and Copper ring and adorned with a silver mosaic, this knife is built to last the rigors of every new flavor-packed campaign, with just the right amount of visual distinction. Stain resistant and easy to clean, the cleverly crafted blade is low maintenance but high performance, with an expertly engineered look and feel that will ensure victory whether at home or in professional settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CYbYNpDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B0BGQVK937","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-427000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGQVK937","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGQVK937","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
